                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Lets add something about this being a temporary workaround until we get to the bottom of why the NCSI is needing to be restarted.  We don't have this issue on any other system that uses NSCI NICs, so there might be a unique firmware / hardware issue related to the NIC we're seeing on Anacapa.  We should get this debugged so it can be fixed for EVT2 or DVT."
